Font Picker (apps/font_picker)
==============================

This application is a port of Javascript Font Picker
(https://www.jsfontpicker.com/), and is distributed under the MIT
License.

    Portions Copyright (c) 2024-2025 Zygomatic
    Portions Copyright (c) 2026 Aether developers

The Zygomatic portions are the original work this port derives from: the
font-picker model and behaviour reproduced in picker_engine.ae — the
compressed family record format, the default-variant selection rule, the
font naming scheme, Levenshtein fuzzy search with its length-difference
threshold, the family filter and sort comparators, and the list ordering
that hoists favourites and the current selection. Upstream's licence
notice is reproduced verbatim and unaltered in LICENSE-jsfontpicker, as
that licence requires.

The Aether developers portions are the work done to make it an aether-ui
application: the Aether implementations themselves, the native dialog in
font_picker.ae, font discovery from the local filesystem, previews
rendered from real font files through vg.font and vg.text_path, the unit
tests in test_picker_engine.ae, and the driver spec in
tests/font_picker/spec_font_picker.ae.

Both sets of portions are offered under the same MIT terms; see
LICENSE-jsfontpicker for the full text.
